(4241, 'refers to a noticeable or significant outcome that happens very quickly, typically within a very short time, such as a single night. It often implies that the result is sudden and possibly unexpected.', 'có được kết quả tốt, thành công chỉ sau một đêm', 1, 3917, 6586, '', 1, 1, '', '', '', 'an overnight result\nan overnight success: thành công chỉ  sau một đêm'),
(4242, 'to change, usually in a way that brings an improvement:', 'thay đổi (sang cái mới)', 1, 3918, 6587, '', 1, 1, 'switch sth <=> up', '', '', ''),
(4243, 'means to fully commit to something, often taking a significant risk or putting all effort, resources, or focus into achieving a goal or outcome. It suggests giving your complete dedication without holding back. It often implies a mix of boldness, confidence, and risk.', 'chơi hết mình, chơi tất tay, dốc toàn lực, nỗ lực hết mình', 1, 3919, 6588, '', 1, 1, '', '', 'The term comes from poker, where \"going all in\" means betting all your chips on a single hand, signifying total commitment to the outcome of that round.', ''),
